 en:['Home','Articles','Photos','Independent spreadsheet. Not operated by or affiliated with Joyagoo.','Joyagoo Spreadsheet: Finds, QC Photos & Image Search','Find your next item. Check the details.','Search the catalogue, compare USD prices and review available product and QC photos before opening the matching item on Joyagoo.','Browse by category','Latest finds','How to use the Joyagoo spreadsheet','Find','Search by name, source ID or image. Narrow your selection by category and sort by newest, popularity or price.','Check','Open the full gallery and compare the item, measurements and chosen variation. Available images may include seller photos; they are not a guarantee of warehouse QC.','Buy','Open the same source product on Joyagoo. Confirm stock, options, price and any charges there before ordering.','Guides for your next haul','A searchable Joyagoo finds catalogue','A spreadsheet helps you organise product discovery. This catalogue brings shoes, hoodies, jerseys and accessories into searchable pages with product photos, USD prices and individual purchase links. Image search compares visual similarity on your device.','Plan beyond the product price','The listed item price is only one part of your budget. Read the QC, buying and shipping guides to review measurements, warehouse steps and parcel costs before you order.','Catalogue snapshot','View all articles'],
